filters availabilityDomain, compartmentId,
displayName; exact availabilityDomain,
compartmentId, and displayName match
conflicts: none
open gaps: none
Recorded OCI create and update responses include
the resource body; generatedruntime confirms
lifecycle through explicit GetFileSystem
follow-up reads rather than the provider-local
WaitForCreatedState helper.
ChangeFileSystemCompartment and clone-detach
behavior are outside the published generic
runtime, so their fields are replacement-only.
areQuotaRulesEnabled is accepted only when
creating through this runtime because
ToggleQuotaRules is not published.
Delete retains the finalizer through DELETING
until DELETED or NotFound. There are no Secret
side effects.
end note
